<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main">
<hi rendition="#g">Die</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Weisheit des Brahmanen,<lb/>
ein Lehrgedicht in Bruch&#x017F;tücken.</hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#g">Von</hi><lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#g">Friedrich Rückert</hi></docAuthor>.</byline><lb/>
